%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 640dcf76f39a68442a74b006f719c02f, type: 3}
  m_Name: event_moonstone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cooking::Cooking.Data.NightEventDefinition
  id: event_moonstone
  displayNameZh: "\u6708\u5149\u6652\u5230\u7684\u77F3\u5934"
  displayNameEn: Moonlit Stone
  unlockNight: 3
  introPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
  options:
  - optionId: opt_moon_look
    order: 1
    displayNameZh: "\u7AEF\u8BE6"
    displayNameEn: Study from afar
    conditionType: 0
    conditionValue: 0
    successFaces: 6
    rewards:
    - pickMode: 0
      ingredientId: ing_shrimp
      count: 3
    successPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e94ae6311ee3a3b41af55d8f4e9e88fc, type: 3}
    failPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - optionId: opt_moon_touch
    order: 2
    displayNameZh: "\u89E6\u6478"
    displayNameEn: Touch it
    conditionType: 0
    conditionValue: 0
    successFaces: 5
    rewards:
    - pickMode: 0
      ingredientId: ing_cucumber
      count: 5
    successPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b356976984a41c4cb994867d0a90a79, type: 3}
    failPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - optionId: 
    phase: 0
    order: 1
    textZh: "\u77F3\u5934\u5728\u6708\u5149\u4E0B\u6709\u7740\u6444\u4EBA\u5FC3\u9B44\u7684\u7F8E\uFF0C\u90A3\u62B9\u767D\u8272\u6D53\u5F97\u8FD1\u4E4E\u4E8E\u9C9C\u8840\u3002\u4E5F\u8BB8\u5B83\u672C\u5C31\u662F\u6708\u5CA9\u7684\u4E00\u90E8\u5206\uFF0C\u6240\u4EE5\u624D\u5982\u6B64\u5723\u6D01\u3002\u4F60\u53D1\u89C9\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u53CC\u811A\u6B63\u671D\u5B83\u8FC8\u52A8\u3002"
    textEn: The stone under moonlight is hauntingly beautiful, that white almost
      as thick as blood. Maybe it was once part of the moonrock, and that is why
      it feels so pure. You notice your feet already moving toward it.
  - optionId: opt_moon_look
    phase: 1
    order: 1
    textZh: "\u77F3\u5934\u8FB9\uFF0C\u4E00\u6EE9\u6C34\u5012\u6620\u7740\u6708\u4EAE\u3002\u6C34\u6D3C\u6B63\u6025\u5267\u7F29\u5C0F\uFF0C\u4F60\u610F\u8BC6\u5230\u8FD9\u662F\u90A3\u5757\u77F3\u5934\u5728\u5438\u6C34\u3002\u77F3\u5934\u7684\u989C\u8272\u663E\u5F97\u8D8A\u53D1\u4E30\u76C8\u4E86\uFF0C\u800C\u6C34\u4E2D\u7684\u5C0F\u9C7C\u5C0F\u867E\u7EB7\u7EB7\u5728\u5E72\u6E34\u4E2D\u8E66\u8D77\u6765\u3002"
    textEn: "Beside the stone, a puddle mirrors the moon. It shrinks fast\u2014you
      realize the stone is drinking. Its color grows richer while the little fish
      and shrimp leap in thirst."
  - optionId: opt_moon_touch
    phase: 1
    order: 1
    textZh: "\u4F60\u628A\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u53CC\u624B\u6309\u5728\u77F3\u5934\u7684\u8868\u9762\u4E0A\uFF0C\u5B83\u6BD4\u4F60\u60F3\u7684\u8FD8\u8981\u5149\u6ED1\u3002\u968F\u7740\u624B\u90E8\u7684\u52A8\u4F5C\uFF0C\u8111\u6D77\u4E2D\u7ADF\u4E5F\u54CD\u8D77\u97F3\u4E50\u58F0\u3002\u4F60\u98D8\u98D8\u6B32\u4ED9\uFF0C\u611F\u5230\u81EA\u5DF1\u65E0\u6240\u4E0D\u80FD\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u521B\u9020\u4E00\u5207\uFF0C\u751A\u81F3\u4E00\u6839\u9EC4\u74DC\u3002"
    textEn: "You press both hands to the stone; smoother than you expected. As your
      hands move, music rises in your mind. You float, feeling you can create anything\u2014even
      a cucumber."
